WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.562
What's up guys and welcome
to another Theme Park Shark

00:00:02.562 --> 00:00:04.840
shark bites here at Disney
California Adventure.

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:07.746
We are reviewing an Oogie
Boogie Bash exclusive item.

00:00:07.746 --> 00:00:09.200
I am in costume as you can see.

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:11.760
This is the combustible components pizza.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:17.705
So it is a colossal pizza slice. Yes,
it is very big with red pepper pesto,

00:00:17.705 --> 00:00:22.402
mozzarella, cheddar, portobello,
and button mushrooms, hot link,

00:00:22.402 --> 00:00:27.540
pepperoni, and Italian sausage with
an arugula salad even on the side.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:30.512
So, I mean, just to give
you guys some reference here

00:00:30.512 --> 00:00:33.260
on how big, it takes two
hands to hold the pizza.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:35.080
And things are falling.

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:37.060
A lot of things are falling.

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:38.700
Are you ready?

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:44.640
For the very first time, a shark
bite inside of a shark bite.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:47.480
Yeah, okay, here we go.

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:51.020
Cheers, everyone.

00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:01.120
First bite, crispy.

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:03.620
A little bit of garlic, but it's crispy.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:07.820
Crispy and garlicky.

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:09.580
Keep guessing.

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:10.680
What do you guys think
my score is going to be?

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:14.580
There's going to be a mushroom in
this next bite, more pepperoni.

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:16.780
But the whole thing is
crispy and it's spongy.

00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:20.040
It's like a spongy, almost like
a deep dish, Chicago-style pizza.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:21.280
Interesting.

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:22.280
Interesting, interesting, interesting.

00:01:22.360 --> 00:01:23.560
The whole thing just feels like crust.

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:25.440
I'll give you another look at that.

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:26.480
Thick.

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:27.280
A lot of bread.

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:29.100
You gotta like a bready pizza.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:31.440
If you like a bready pizza,
this might be for you.

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:46.400
8-3.

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:47.540
8-3.

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:49.680
That's an 8-3.

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:51.440
It's a good slice.

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:52.560
I would order it again.

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:54.680
I would order it again.

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:56.820
It is an 8-3.

00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:00.400
It's no 9, but it is in the 8s.

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:03.300
It's one of the better
in-park slices I've ever had.

00:02:03.780 --> 00:02:05.700
Downtown Disney, of course, you
get some really good slices.

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:10.780
But inside any theme park, that
includes Universal, even Epcot.

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:12.420
A good slice.

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:14.800
So an 8.3, I recommend it.

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:16.300
And I do want to say this.

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:18.200
I took a bite further into the pizza,

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:22.960
and what I noticed is that some of the
meats that are further along in the pizza

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:23.780
are way more spicy.

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:26.360
So I'm not going to change my score,

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:28.677
but what I do want to
change is letting you

00:02:28.677 --> 00:02:30.940
guys know that there's some spice to this.

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:31.800
There's a kick to this.

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:35.000
So I'm going to do a separate
review for the arugula salad.

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:37.440
I'll be as fair as
possible on that as well.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:42.180
So cheers on the salad.

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:46.580
Yeah.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.840
That is a very light dressing.

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:52.960
Almost like a light Caesar.

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:54.360
Like a light Caesar almost.

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:55.500
Very light.

00:02:56.360 --> 00:03:00.220
Kind of, you know, the lettuce is
a little, you know, you can tell.

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:02.080
But what do I give this?

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:08.420
There's some hints of Italian in it.

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:09.640
8.2.

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:10.180
8.2.

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:14.700
So, all together, around the same
across the board on everything here.

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:18.900
So, a good dish for a
